## Why This Is Asked
Why this is asked: tests ability to enforce governance at scale across regions, tying policy, compliance, and cost to a live data/ML pipeline.

## Key Concepts
- Azure Policy and Blueprints
- Data residency and RBAC
- Drift detection and automated remediation
- Edge-to-cloud pipeline: IoT Hub, Data Lake Gen2, Synapse, Databricks, AzureML
- DR, BYOK, cost governance

