## Why This Is Asked
Tests the ability to design a compliant, scalable data fabric that integrates confidential computing, data governance, and cross-region disaster recovery while optimizing costs for enterprise customers.

## Key Concepts
- MQTT telemetry ingestion through Azure IoT Hub
- Event Grid-based event routing to Confidential Compute
- SGX-based confidential processing (AKS or Confidential VMs)
- Data Lake Storage Gen2 with immutability and WORM protection
- Synapse Analytics lakehouse with per-tenant RBAC and row-level security
- Microsoft Purview for data governance and lineage
- BYOK encryption with Azure Key Vault integration
- Paired region disaster recovery with geo-replication
- Cost optimization through tiered storage and auto-scaling

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudocode: redactPII for telemetry events
function redactPII(event) {
  // Remove or mask PII fields based on tenant policies
  const sanitizedEvent = {
    ...event,
    userId: event.userId ? hashPII(event.userId) : null,
    ipAddress: null,
    location: event.location ? obfuscateLocation(event.location) : null
  };
  return sanitizedEvent;
}
```

## Why This Is Asked

This question evaluates practical experience designing observable, scalable Azure telemetry pipelines with proper instrumentation, tenant isolation, and comprehensive monitoring integration for enterprise-grade media analytics platforms.

## Key Concepts

- OpenTelemetry integration across Event Hubs, Databricks, and Delta Lake
- End-to-end trace correlation and structured logging
- Adaptive sampling strategies and retention policies
- Tenant-level RBAC and data governance
- Comprehensive monitoring with Application Insights and Azure Monitor
- Real-time alerting and SLA management

## Code Example

```javascript
// Propagate correlation across services
const traceHeader = appInsights.getCorrelationContext();
const traceId = traceHeader.traceId;

// Instrument Event Hubs producer
eventHubProducer.send({
  body: eventData,
  properties: {
    traceId: traceId,
    tenantId: tenantId,
    region: region,
    timestamp: new Date().toISOString()
  }
});

// Configure OpenTelemetry sampling
const sampler = new ParentBasedSampler({
  root: new TraceIdRatioBasedSampler(0.01) // 1% production
});
```
